    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages the Add Model button that allows the user to scan a new QR code. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The button toggles between an &quot;add&quot; icon (shows a confirmation popup) and a &quot;cancel&quot; icon (cancels an in-progress QR scan). Reacts to StateMachine state changes to keep its state consistent. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
